{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：南京银行二季度净利息收入增41%，零售不良率降7个基点</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">南京银行<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报最值得看的不是利润增速，而是净利息收入。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在8月18日发布的研报中确认，南京银行<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，与预期基本一致，但净利息收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预测高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>。这份财报同时显示资产质量改善，零售贷款不良率半年下降7个基点。利润没有惊喜，收入结构却给出了明确信号。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告认为市场可能更关注净利息收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>和资产质量<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，这两点足以支撑正面的市场反应。先看数字，再看机制。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWamVSYgKJpLdAqmzxqsoIEXgtHhgKiaQ9SwkU8aFWVf9D63ZvpHXACB9rWicro7ogaqmibTerwZlkibjkuAyqDTAoAj41BhYKylJM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 净利息收入增长来自债券配置和负债成本下降</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>净利息收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">111.26亿元</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>，同比大增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">41%</span>。拆开看，上半年债券利息收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>，日均余额增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>，研究资产明显向持有至到期债券倾斜。这类资产不按市值波动，直接贡献利息收入。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">另一个支撑来自存贷利差。上半年贷款回报表现下降13个基点，但存款成本下降22个基点，存贷利差反而扩大了9个基点。净息差上半年环比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>1个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.79%</span>。贷款端利率还在往下走，但负债端成本降得更快，利差就能稳住。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看存款成本下降22个基点这个数字，它比贷款回报表现变化更关键。简单说，银行在资产端定价权有限，但负债端通过调整存款结构、压降高成本定期存款，仍然能挤出利润空间；后续更值得观察的是存款成本下降能否持续，而不是贷款回报表现何时企稳。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUO4jcqpvqgPqPncdibM8WO780ib734haM1BuqOuwABMUMLYibTa0MvRPmIgQkub42MCu4kIbscjvibPAg8tTc3cC4N0fA9jbGTnPE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 零售资产质量<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，对公房地产和建筑仍在<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">承压</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>不良贷款率降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.82%</span>，环比下降1个基点。更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是前瞻性指标：上半年关注类贷款占比下降19个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.97%</span>，逾期贷款占比下降8个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.20%</span>。零售贷款不良率降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.42%</span>，半年下降7个基点，这是报告明确提到的正面意外。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但对公端并不均衡。房地产行业不良率从2H25的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.81%</span>升至1H26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.37%</span>，建筑业从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.89%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.12%</span>。制造业不良率也从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.99%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.10%</span>。零售在修复，对公的部分行业仍在暴露不确定性，资产质量的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>是结构性的，不是全面好转。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 零售不良率下降7个基点，这个<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>幅度在城商行里不多见。我的理解是，南京银行零售贷款占比在下降，分母调整本身会压低不良率，不完全是存量资产质量变好；更值得关注的是对公房地产和建筑两个行业的不良率还在往上走，这才是后续资产质量的真正变量。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW2beAp43TsxWQRS3rkSiaVTtQqPpE9AgzKmrmPWFul7l9bJWSd8Nvh5UhAICMmcCQ0Iag4iaxkSNYxUOWywGhpOia6f6Xns2ON20/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 中间业务收入调整，担保业务停摆是主要影响</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>手续费收入同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>，非利息收入下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">33%</span>，分别比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预测低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">27%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28%</span>。报告明确指出，上半年担保费收入同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">31%</span>，是手续费增长的主要影响，原因可能是融资担保业务自一季度起暂停。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这不是需求问题，是业务资格问题。担保业务暂停属于一次性因素，如果后续恢复，手续费收入基数会明显<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>。但报告没有给出恢复时间表，这里仍需验证。</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">4. 成本控制和资本充足率提供安全边际</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>营业收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，运营支出仅增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，拨备前利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>，比预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUB9vsojBibDgA7szlJacckBlPlqsILBg6Y6Zm1xXlJJP8sGZy73w0j5jL7054Y40Vfj6IL57n23MfMLJAkKKxXoztGKQIicQtv8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 44-JPM-Bank of Nanjing-A-601009-2Q26- In-line earnings- but NII and AQ surprise positively-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
